## The assembly cell picks: programs/pick.cell run by the simulator --
## the arm takes its tweezers and puts the DIP from the tray in the vise,
## the turntable turns it, the arm picks the LED, and both fall when let
## go -- each command's outcome a line: ok, what it did, and why not.
## Title: The assembly cell picks
## Page: cell/live/?program=pick watch it pick, step by step, live
## Run: just demo cell pick

"ce:" u_se< "Cell"
"bl:" u_se< "Blender"

"each command: ok, its end time, its events and warnings"
ce:r_un bl:r_ead "programs/pick.cell"
